":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v2Frl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"715c13ca-3aa0-4162-b9bc-3428074dd703","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"```for my ($foo, $bar, $baz) (1..4) { ... }```\nであまった分は undef になる感じ。","ts":"1632279354.004700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HyX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"882F5139-5E2E-447B-BD8A-48E856E1AC92","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"Perlのバージョンが上がることはないのでついていけない運命…","ts":"1632279302.004000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"cry","count":1,"users":["U7H4TJEG0"]},{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U01NKCTP7B4"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tAG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"828d5b9f-4366-4d3b-87bf-d981ad38c038","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/Perl/RFCs\u003e\nここ見るといいらしいです。","ts":"1632279256.002900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"Perl/RFCs","id":1,"title":"Perl/RFCs","text":"This repository is for Requests For Comments - proposals to change the Perl language.","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"29","short":true},{"title":"Last updated","value":"5 days ago","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R3KvY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53f0db06-594d-4603-b507-4d04a957b672","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"モダン言語ぽさ。","ts":"1632279222.002500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dSi/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fab8ce60-7001-4a2c-adff-f36975f88018","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"もしくは\n```for my ($foo, $bar, $baz) (@array) { ... }```","ts":"1632279205.002300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JQLZp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0df75205-d53d-4555-b4c3-f8eff6be5b49","type":"message","user":"U0